player_prompt.intro:
Keddi Player {player_id} i ɛmɛnayen 3 n imɛnayen n Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Asalɛmɛn {num_rounds} isɛlɛn.
Tasɛlt n isɛlɛn:
• {conv_rounds} isɛlɛn n imɛzriyen
• 1 asɛlt n asenti - ɛsker yiwen token i kullu abɛzzi: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' neɣ '[<opp-id> defect]' (i.e. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default 'cooperate'). 
Tasɛlt n imɛzriyen n payoffs (ɛzɛntɛn i kullu azɛnti):
  - Kullu cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Kullu defect     ->  {punishment}
  - Keddi defect, abɛzzi cooperate -> {temptation}
  - Keddi cooperate, abɛzzi defect -> {sucker}
Aqeddac (ɛn) i yesɛan asɛntel n yisɛlɛn iɛɛlen i taggara n isɛlɛn akk iɛɛlen.
